      "ok": true,
      "key": "AUDIT-010",
      "title": "Changes to customer email are audited",
      "statement": "Every endpoint, AI tool, task or message handler that writes an email address (the email or requester_email field) must call the record_audit_event function unconditionally, so the audit_log records who changed what. Functions that do the write are not inspected by this rule yet: keep the audit call in the caller that always runs. An object that cannot audit its write is exempted by the policy owner, not by tagging it.",
      "enforcement": "advisory",
      "active": true,
      "severity": "high",
      "rules": [
        {
          "id": "AUDIT-010.R1",
          "title": "",
          "check": "object.statement_required",
          "params": {
            "statements": [],
            "functions": [
              "record_audit_event"
            ],
            "placement": "unconditional",
            "must_reference": [],
            "when": {
              "fields": [
                "email",
                "requester_email"
              ]
            },
            "tags": [],
            "api_groups": [],
            "tables": [],
            "verbs": [],
            "endpoint_auth": "",
            "except_tags": [],
            "object_kinds": [
              "query",
              "task",
              "tool",
              "message"
            ],
            "reaching_table_tags": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "file": "COST-010.xs",
      "ok": true,
      "key": "COST-010",
      "title": "AI calls and retries stay inside bounded work",
      "statement": "No AI agent call sits inside a loop, because one loop can run the call thousands of times and run up the bill. No background task uses a while loop, because a while loop that retries can run forever. A task that must retry uses a bounded foreach over the items to retry, with an attempt limit written in the task. A task or call that truly needs a loop the rule does not allow is exempted by the policy owner, not by renaming it.",
      "enforcement": "advisory",
      "active": true,
      "severity": "high",
      "rules": [
        {
          "id": "COST-010.R1",
          "title": "",
          "check": "statement.containment",
          "params": {
            "statements": [
              "ai.agent.run"
            ],
            "must_be_inside": [],
            "must_not_be_inside": [
              "foreach",
              "while"
            ],
            "must_contain": [],
            "min_count": 1,
            "tags": [],
            "api_groups": [],
            "tables": [],
            "verbs": [],
            "endpoint_auth": "",
            "except_tags": [],
            "object_kinds": [],
            "reaching_table_tags": []
